  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Dungarbhai Bhimjibhai Kela vs S.K.Prajapati, Food Safety Officer on 4 September, 2025 C/Ca/47/2024 Order",
    "facts": "This is an application, filed under Section 5 of the Limitation Act, seeking condonation of delay of 447 days, which has caused in filing the Appeal. Learned advocate for the applicant has submitted that applicant was infected with Corona Virus, therefore, applicant could not approach any advocate. It is further submitted that due to pandemic situation of Covid-19, the applicant was not able to pay attention to his business. Resultantly, he was suffering from severe financial crisis. It is further submitted that there is no NEUTRAL CITATION C/CA/47/2024 ORDER DATED: 04/09/2025 undefined intentional delay on the part of the applicant and therefore, delay may be condoned.",
